flowchart TD
    A[Idea Queue] --> B[Validate Input]
    B --> C[Pull Context]
    C --> D[Generate Draft with AI]
    D --> E[Validate Output Schema]
    E --> F{Passes QA?}
    F -- No --> G[Send to Revision Queue]
    F -- Yes --> H[Approval Step]
    H --> I{Approved?}
    I -- No --> J[Archive / Revise]
    I -- Yes --> K[Render or Publish]
    K --> L[Store Asset Metadata]
    L --> M[Log Completion]
